lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Arrow Keys or WASD Keys</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump &amp; Menu Selections</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong>\u00a0Right Face Button (&quot;O&quot; on Playstation, &quot;B&quot; on Xbox)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong>\u00a0&quot;Z&quot; or &quot;J&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> Bottom face button (&quot;X&quot; on Playstation, &quot;A&quot; on Xbox)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong>\u00a0&quot;Control&quot; or &quot;K&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> &quot;Options&quot; button on Playstation,\u00a0&quot;Start&quot; button on Xbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong>\u00a0&quot;Enter&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip/Unequip Weapon</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong>\u00a0Top face Button (&quot;\u25b3&quot; on Playstation, &quot;Y&quot; on Xbox)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong>\u00a0&quot;Shift&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overlay Menu* (for quick reset or volume control)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> &quot;Share&quot; on Playstation, &quot;Back&quot; on Xbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong>\u00a0&quot;Esc&quot; key<br><i>*Please note that options in the Overlay Menu can only be selected by using a mouse</i></